WEBVTT


1
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:04.960
Have you ever tried getting lost?

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.480
Letting yourself
go with the road.

3
00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:18.440
On the road,
my thoughts wandered.

4
00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:26.120
I became that child again,
full of passion and curiosity.

5
00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.560
I found myself.

6
00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:39.080
I found the thrill of the unknown
beyond the next bend.

7
00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:46.120
I returned to the moments
that shaped me.

8
00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:52.960
That made me who I am.

9
00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:02.000
On the road, I accepted myself.

10
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.660
I accepted every wrong decision
that made my journey more enjoyable.

11
00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:12.760
And as the night grew quiet,
I carried on.

12
00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:18.880
I looked ahead, further and further,
without looking back.

13
00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:24.360
I reached a place
where I recognised nothing.

14
00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:29.500
Then I knew.
I was lost.

15
00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:40.720
Was I?

16
00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:47.060
In truth,
we were never lost.

17
00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:54.220
Every moment,
we are searching for our passion.
